{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52193","headline":"颂六十二首 十八 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惰学迷三教，问者不知一。\n合萼不结核，敷华何得实。\n徒生高慢心，凌他非好毕。\n坠落幽闇道，开闭牢深密。\n一入百千年，万亿苦逼切。\n对苦悔无知，方由堕慢媟。\n至人善取譬，立志须明律。\n英雄慢法时，焉知悔今日。\n（见同书卷十六《堕慢部》。\n又见百卷本《法苑珠林》卷五四。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52193.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52193","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}